# N=10 traversals with 30s DWELL between cycles —
# models inter-traversal external AOCS desat (mag torquer / RCS).
#
# Same gait as multi_traversal_10x.seq; difference is a 30s settle
# at the end of each cycle (after dock 9, 19, 29, 39) to let the
# AOCS bring h_w back to ~zero before the next cycle starts. The
# final cycle (49) is followed by the default trailing settle.
#
# Hypothesis: with brief inter-cycle desat the linear-extrapolation
# mission scaling should hold; without (multi_traversal_10x.seq),
# h_w accumulates and step 22 timed out.

START anchor_3a anchor_3b

# === Cycle 1 ===
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_5a
DOCK anchor_6b
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_3a
DOCK anchor_3b
DWELL 30

# === Cycle 2 ===
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_5a
DOCK anchor_6b
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_3a
DOCK anchor_3b
DWELL 30

# === Cycle 3 ===
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_5a
DOCK anchor_6b
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_3a
DOCK anchor_3b
DWELL 30

# === Cycle 4 ===
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_5a
DOCK anchor_6b
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_3a
DOCK anchor_3b
DWELL 30

# === Cycle 5 (final) ===
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_5a
DOCK anchor_6b
DOCK anchor_5b
DOCK anchor_4a
DOCK anchor_4b
DOCK anchor_3a
DOCK anchor_3b
